{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgj9g7bQPhokg1VPPPJmy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RGEdB6wJQpDTKQsDcSXLRB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 1,48p docs/ASSETS.md | cut -c1-300; echo ....; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"surgical\" 2>&1 | head -12; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"bed\" 2>&1 | head -14; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"monitor\" 2>&1 | head -8; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"lamp\" 2>&1 | head -8; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"bench desk chair cabinet\" 2>&1 | head -12; grep -n -i \"hospital\\|medical\\|scrubs\\|nurse\\|doctor\" src/assets/catalogs/*.json | cut -c1-160 | head -12","description":"Check the asset library for hospital props"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15206,"cache_read_input_tokens":202055,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15206},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3415d082-194f-4b08-a98a-256652a62b17","uuid":"3272872f-d5b5-4419-8264-7b2ba865c655","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:28:59.484Z","request_id":"req_011Cgj9g7JnrbVwUZA7ZjRzq","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01RGEdB6wJQpDTKQsDcSXLRB":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211908__x0e7d30/work/_research/engine/dist/handoff && sed -n 1,48p docs/ASSETS.md | cut -c1-300; echo ....; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"surgical\" 2>&1 | head -12; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"bed\" 2>&1 | head -14; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"monitor\" 2>&1 | head -8; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"lamp\" 2>&1 | head -8; node tools/asset-find.mjs \"bench desk chair cabinet\" 2>&1 | head -12; grep -n -i \"hospital\\|medical\\|scrubs\\|nurse\\|doctor\" src/assets/catalogs/*.json | cut -c1-160 | head -12","description":"Check the asset library for hospital props"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01RGEdB6wJQpDTKQsDcSXLRB":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211908__x0e7d30/work/_research/engine/dist/handoff"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RGEdB6wJQpDTKQsDcSXLRB","type":"tool_result","content":"# Objects and materials as data\n\nThe full engine draws still objects (barrels, tables, trees, wells) from a few lines of data, in every view and facing,\nwith the house shading and outline, and gives every surface (floors, wall faces, wall tops, platform tiles, the objects'\nown faces) a material from one open registry. An object costs one to a few hundred tokens of data (the core's median is\n125); you check it headless with one command. Read this card whole before you write one. (The agent edition keeps the\nregistries and ignores the calls: `E.addAssets` returns empty lists, the others null.)\n\n## Use one\n\n```js\n// in draw(r): feet on the point, depth sorted like an actor; its front toward facing\nr.shape('barrel', x, y, 0, { facing: Math.PI / 2 });\n// once, before the updates: bodies stop at it, a body coming down lands on it, one wholly below passes under\nmap.solid('table', 120, 80, 0, { facing: 0 });\n// a sprite of it, for an inventory or a HUD (r.sprite, px.sprite)\nconst icon = E.shapeSprite('chest', { view: 'iso' });\n```\n\n- **r.shape options:** facing (radians, where the front points: 0 east, π/2 south, as written), scale, mats ({ slot:\n  material }), flip (mirrors it x to -x, collision too), params (a generator's: { h: 30 }), bias, hides (default true),\n  light (adds its lights to game.lights), shadow (default true).\n- **map.solid** takes the same id and placement, so one object can feed both calls. Bodies span z to z + h (E.Body's h, 32).\n- **In 3D** the 3D engine draws the same entries, materials and boxes: `world.shape(id, x, y, z, o)` (its header).\n- **Steep views** (top-down) draw shapes from the characters' lower angle, as rigs are drawn. The light comes from the\n  viewer's upper left in every view.\n- **Glow and fire:** a material with glow: 1 ignores the light and stays bright in the dark; an entry's flames ([[x, y, z,\n  w, h]]) draw the engine's animated flame (r.shape only: a sprite has none). Anything else that moves stays a prop\n  (r.prop) or your own code.\n- **Dressing a generated level:** a scene is a few entries as [id, across, forward] from an anchor (a wall spot, forward\n  into the room); place it whole or not at all, each part on free floor, after the level's own random picks and from a\n  seeded stream of its own, so the level stays as its seed builds it (Emberdeep's `src/emberdeep/53-scenes.js`).\n\n## The core library\n\n**Shapes** (sized for a 26-unit hero; generators take params): barrel, crate, chest, table, chair, stool, bench, bed,\nbookcase, shelf, pot, jar, sack, cart, well, sign, lamppost, anvil; fence { len: 16 }, pine { h: 41, tiers: 4 },\ntree { h: 40, seed: 1 }, bush { r: 7 }, grass { h: 6, n: 6 }, rock { r: 7.5, seed: 2 }, crystal { h: 18, seed: 1 }.\n`r.shape('pine', x, y, 0, { params: { h: 30 } })`; `E.SHAPES.barrel.about` says what each is.\n\n**Materials:** woods oak walnut birch crate plank planks wood; stones stone cobble marble granite sandstone slate rock\nbrick flagstone ruin; metals iron steel gold copper bronze metal rusted; clay glazed porcelain; cloth linen burlap wool velvet leather;\nplants bark needles leaves shrub moss straw hedge grass; ground dirt sand snow mud; water ice crystal flame bone shingle;\nwalls timber plaster; tops speckle plain tiles slab; tiles block bonus ground pipe checker.\n\n## Materials on surfaces\n\n```js\n....\nno match for \"surgical\"\nbed                                shape      85 tok  wooden bed, red blanket, head at the back  [furniture inn]\nkaykit-dungeon-remastered:bed-decorated shape     648 tok  wooden bed, white sheets, candle stand and a grey box  [furniture bed bedroom dungeon inn]\nkaykit-dungeon-remastered:bed-frame shape     268 tok  low wooden bed with a grey blanket and white pillow  [furniture bed bedroom dungeon inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-double-a shape     241 tok  brown wood double bed, white sheets, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-double-b shape     274 tok  brown wood double bed, tall head and footboard, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-single-a shape     249 tok  brown wood single bed, white pillow, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-single-b shape     300 tok  brown wood single bed, tall head and footboard, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkenney-fantasy-town:cart           shape     179 tok  wooden hand cart, plank bed, grey wheels  [vehicle town farm market]\nkenney-furniture:bed-double        shape     142 tok  wide light wood bed, white sheet, pink blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkenney-furniture:bed-single        shape     229 tok  narrow light wood bed, white sheet, pink blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkenney-furniture:cabinet-bed-drawer shape     107 tok  small light wood nightstand with a drawer, short feet  [furniture bedroom house]\nkenney-furniture:cabinet-bed-drawer-table shape     109 tok  small light wood nightstand, drawer over an open shelf  [furniture bedroom house]\nkenney-nature:bed                  shape     305 tok  low wooden cot, white mattress, teal blanket  [furniture camp bedroom]\nkenney-nature:bed-floor            shape     155 tok  bedroll on the ground, white mat, teal blanket  [furniture camp]\nno match for \"monitor\"\nlamppost                           shape      76 tok  iron street lamp, glowing head  [town light]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small-decorated shape     489 tok  small brown nightstand topped with an orange lamp and trinkets  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:lamp-standing shape     113 tok  floor lamp, white bell shade on a thin grey pole  [light lounge house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:lamp-table   shape     142 tok  table lamp, wide white cloth shade, small blue base  [light bedroom house]\nkenney-furniture:lamp-round-table  shape      97 tok  small table lamp, round cream shade, white stem  [light bedroom house]\nkenney-furniture:lamp-square-floor shape      95 tok  tall floor lamp, long cream shade on a white pole  [light lounge house]\nkenney-furniture:lamp-square-table shape      97 tok  small table lamp, square cream shade, white stem  [light bedroom house]\nkenney-graveyard:lightpost-single  shape     360 tok  green iron lamppost, one hanging yellow lamp  [light graveyard town]\nkenney-furniture:chair-desk        shape     262 tok  office chair, pink seat and back, grey wheeled base  [furniture office house modern]\nbench                              shape      57 tok  plank bench on two trestles  [furniture tavern]\nchair                              shape      78 tok  wooden chair  [furniture tavern]\nkaykit-dungeon-remastered:chair    shape     146 tok  chunky wooden chair with a tall plank back  [furniture chair tavern dungeon]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-medium shape     116 tok  low wide brown wooden cabinet on short feet  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-medium-decorated shape     570 tok  low brown wooden cabinet with potted plants on top  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small shape     170 tok  small brown wooden nightstand, two pale drawers  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small-decorated shape     489 tok  small brown nightstand topped with an orange lamp and trinkets  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-a      shape     277 tok  brown wooden chair, blue seat cushion  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-a-wood shape     136 tok  plain brown wooden chair, straight back  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-b      shape     342 tok  brown wooden chair, blue seat and back cushions  [furniture kitchen house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-b-wood shape     149 tok  plain brown wooden chair, curved open back  [furniture kitchen house tavern]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3415d082-194f-4b08-a98a-256652a62b17","uuid":"5ba78398-319b-4160-adf2-00d32a40a390","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:29:00.527Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Objects and materials as data\n\nThe full engine draws still objects (barrels, tables, trees, wells) from a few lines of data, in every view and facing,\nwith the house shading and outline, and gives every surface (floors, wall faces, wall tops, platform tiles, the objects'\nown faces) a material from one open registry. An object costs one to a few hundred tokens of data (the core's median is\n125); you check it headless with one command. Read this card whole before you write one. (The agent edition keeps the\nregistries and ignores the calls: `E.addAssets` returns empty lists, the others null.)\n\n## Use one\n\n```js\n// in draw(r): feet on the point, depth sorted like an actor; its front toward facing\nr.shape('barrel', x, y, 0, { facing: Math.PI / 2 });\n// once, before the updates: bodies stop at it, a body coming down lands on it, one wholly below passes under\nmap.solid('table', 120, 80, 0, { facing: 0 });\n// a sprite of it, for an inventory or a HUD (r.sprite, px.sprite)\nconst icon = E.shapeSprite('chest', { view: 'iso' });\n```\n\n- **r.shape options:** facing (radians, where the front points: 0 east, π/2 south, as written), scale, mats ({ slot:\n  material }), flip (mirrors it x to -x, collision too), params (a generator's: { h: 30 }), bias, hides (default true),\n  light (adds its lights to game.lights), shadow (default true).\n- **map.solid** takes the same id and placement, so one object can feed both calls. Bodies span z to z + h (E.Body's h, 32).\n- **In 3D** the 3D engine draws the same entries, materials and boxes: `world.shape(id, x, y, z, o)` (its header).\n- **Steep views** (top-down) draw shapes from the characters' lower angle, as rigs are drawn. The light comes from the\n  viewer's upper left in every view.\n- **Glow and fire:** a material with glow: 1 ignores the light and stays bright in the dark; an entry's flames ([[x, y, z,\n  w, h]]) draw the engine's animated flame (r.shape only: a sprite has none). Anything else that moves stays a prop\n  (r.prop) or your own code.\n- **Dressing a generated level:** a scene is a few entries as [id, across, forward] from an anchor (a wall spot, forward\n  into the room); place it whole or not at all, each part on free floor, after the level's own random picks and from a\n  seeded stream of its own, so the level stays as its seed builds it (Emberdeep's `src/emberdeep/53-scenes.js`).\n\n## The core library\n\n**Shapes** (sized for a 26-unit hero; generators take params): barrel, crate, chest, table, chair, stool, bench, bed,\nbookcase, shelf, pot, jar, sack, cart, well, sign, lamppost, anvil; fence { len: 16 }, pine { h: 41, tiers: 4 },\ntree { h: 40, seed: 1 }, bush { r: 7 }, grass { h: 6, n: 6 }, rock { r: 7.5, seed: 2 }, crystal { h: 18, seed: 1 }.\n`r.shape('pine', x, y, 0, { params: { h: 30 } })`; `E.SHAPES.barrel.about` says what each is.\n\n**Materials:** woods oak walnut birch crate plank planks wood; stones stone cobble marble granite sandstone slate rock\nbrick flagstone ruin; metals iron steel gold copper bronze metal rusted; clay glazed porcelain; cloth linen burlap wool velvet leather;\nplants bark needles leaves shrub moss straw hedge grass; ground dirt sand snow mud; water ice crystal flame bone shingle;\nwalls timber plaster; tops speckle plain tiles slab; tiles block bonus ground pipe checker.\n\n## Materials on surfaces\n\n```js\n....\nno match for \"surgical\"\nbed                                shape      85 tok  wooden bed, red blanket, head at the back  [furniture inn]\nkaykit-dungeon-remastered:bed-decorated shape     648 tok  wooden bed, white sheets, candle stand and a grey box  [furniture bed bedroom dungeon inn]\nkaykit-dungeon-remastered:bed-frame shape     268 tok  low wooden bed with a grey blanket and white pillow  [furniture bed bedroom dungeon inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-double-a shape     241 tok  brown wood double bed, white sheets, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-double-b shape     274 tok  brown wood double bed, tall head and footboard, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-single-a shape     249 tok  brown wood single bed, white pillow, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:bed-single-b shape     300 tok  brown wood single bed, tall head and footboard, blue blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkenney-fantasy-town:cart           shape     179 tok  wooden hand cart, plank bed, grey wheels  [vehicle town farm market]\nkenney-furniture:bed-double        shape     142 tok  wide light wood bed, white sheet, pink blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkenney-furniture:bed-single        shape     229 tok  narrow light wood bed, white sheet, pink blanket  [furniture bedroom house inn]\nkenney-furniture:cabinet-bed-drawer shape     107 tok  small light wood nightstand with a drawer, short feet  [furniture bedroom house]\nkenney-furniture:cabinet-bed-drawer-table shape     109 tok  small light wood nightstand, drawer over an open shelf  [furniture bedroom house]\nkenney-nature:bed                  shape     305 tok  low wooden cot, white mattress, teal blanket  [furniture camp bedroom]\nkenney-nature:bed-floor            shape     155 tok  bedroll on the ground, white mat, teal blanket  [furniture camp]\nno match for \"monitor\"\nlamppost                           shape      76 tok  iron street lamp, glowing head  [town light]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small-decorated shape     489 tok  small brown nightstand topped with an orange lamp and trinkets  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:lamp-standing shape     113 tok  floor lamp, white bell shade on a thin grey pole  [light lounge house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:lamp-table   shape     142 tok  table lamp, wide white cloth shade, small blue base  [light bedroom house]\nkenney-furniture:lamp-round-table  shape      97 tok  small table lamp, round cream shade, white stem  [light bedroom house]\nkenney-furniture:lamp-square-floor shape      95 tok  tall floor lamp, long cream shade on a white pole  [light lounge house]\nkenney-furniture:lamp-square-table shape      97 tok  small table lamp, square cream shade, white stem  [light bedroom house]\nkenney-graveyard:lightpost-single  shape     360 tok  green iron lamppost, one hanging yellow lamp  [light graveyard town]\nkenney-furniture:chair-desk        shape     262 tok  office chair, pink seat and back, grey wheeled base  [furniture office house modern]\nbench                              shape      57 tok  plank bench on two trestles  [furniture tavern]\nchair                              shape      78 tok  wooden chair  [furniture tavern]\nkaykit-dungeon-remastered:chair    shape     146 tok  chunky wooden chair with a tall plank back  [furniture chair tavern dungeon]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-medium shape     116 tok  low wide brown wooden cabinet on short feet  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-medium-decorated shape     570 tok  low brown wooden cabinet with potted plants on top  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small shape     170 tok  small brown wooden nightstand, two pale drawers  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:cabinet-small-decorated shape     489 tok  small brown nightstand topped with an orange lamp and trinkets  [furniture bedroom house]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-a      shape     277 tok  brown wooden chair, blue seat cushion  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-a-wood shape     136 tok  plain brown wooden chair, straight back  [furniture kitchen house tavern]\nkaykit-furniture-bits:chair-b      shape     342 tok  brown wooden chair, blue seat and back cushions  [furniture kitchen house]\nkaykit-furniture-bi